# Stable API error codes and their HTTP statuses.
#
# This file freezes the public error-code list. Codes are append-only:
#   - Removing or renaming a code, or changing its status, is a breaking change
#     and makes TestErrorCodesMatchGolden fail.
#   - Adding a code also fails the test until a line is added here, so every
#     new code is an intentional, reviewed change.
#
# Format: CODE HTTP_STATUS
INTERNAL_ERROR 500
INVALID_JSON 400
INVALID_UTF8 400
DUPLICATE_JSON_KEY 400
JSON_TOO_DEEP 400
JSON_LIMIT_EXCEEDED 400
REQUEST_TOO_LARGE 413
UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE 415
INVALID_REQUEST 400
TOOL_UNKNOWN 404
ARGS_SCHEMA_INVALID 400
METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED 405
NOT_FOUND 404
NOT_IMPLEMENTED 501
